    {
      "id": "t022",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 270,
      "y": 1447.0000000000002,
      "w": 460,
      "h": 77.9,
      "text": "While the Narayanpet weaving style would be the main focus, the center will also display and celebrate the various other crafts of Telangana. It will also act as a community space where people from all walks of life come together to celebrate life, and a learning hub for our younger generation.",
      "size": "s",
      "anim": {}
    },
